Subject: [PATCH v2 2/2] arm: dts: nxp: imx: Add devicetree files for M48
Date: Tue, 29 Sep 2026 12:18:10 +0300
Message-ID: <20260929091811.3735201-3-petko.manolov@konsulko.com>
